apped deployments — no external resource fetches); no external network dependencies in any designed flow.\n- Use the existing engineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) as a starting design reference to unblock work, per the strategy's risk mitigation, while formal designs are created.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Wireframes delivered for the list page, create wizard, detail view, and delete confirmation dialog, covering all fields in the agreed TP form-field set.\n- Designs reviewed with Dashboard/Frontend Engineering and Feature Store Engineering; feedback incorporated.\n- Admin and viewer design states are both specified, with write controls absent for viewers.\n- No designed flow or asset depends on external network access (air-gapped compatible).\n- Wizard design reflects the TP field curation agreed with PM and Feature Store Engineering.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables the P0 HLRs for the guided create wizard, the management list page, the inspect view, and the delete flow by providing the designs they are built against.\n- Enables the P1 viewer-browsing HLR (browse without create/delete controls) via the viewer design states.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":47295,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bbdd7d948b51495","agent_id":"adbe888c35f5fced7","session_id":"6ff6a9df-bf42-414a-b8db-47534bab81b1","uuid":"1344754a-fe14-43b3-bb38-2548a6e32356","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:02:57.008Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
