verage; every open question has an explicit disposition (including the edit-capability question correctly resolved as out-of-scope by the strategy itself). Strategy-level context is carried forward: the UXD-delay risk mitigation (prototype PR #7013 as design reference) is in E002 scope, the CRD-stability risk is E001 scope, the viewer-RBAC-bypass risk is an E003 AC, and the air-gapped validation-completeness risk is covered by E001 (validation rules from CRD schema) and E005 (server-side error surfacing). Minor gap: the pod-resource-growth risk's mitigation (\"monitor dashboard pod resource consumption in QE environments\") is not carried into any epic's scope or ACs — a dropped secondary mitigation, not a capability gap.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41246,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8bb5f9cf8a8fdc6","agent_id":"aa4b698e26a62b72b","session_id":"6ff6a9df-bf42-414a-b8db-47534bab81b1","uuid":"8ca1a29d-e0c4-4fd6-b3c0-6410d64ed933","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:09:34.855Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
